OL,3,AEleven officers convicted of crimes
OL,4,Astill on police payroll, chief confirms
OL,5,
OL,6,FEleven officers who have been convicted
OL,7,Fof crimes - including eight who have
OL,8,Fbeen violent towards women and girls -
OL,9,Fare still on the Police Scotland pay
OL,10,Froll.
OL,12,FIn a letter to the Scottish
OL,13,FParliament's justice committee, Chief
OL,14,FConstable Jo Farrell said there were
OL,15,Fother cases with "incontrovertible
OL,16,Fevidence" against officers, but they
OL,17,Fcannot be sacked quickly enough.
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
