OL,3,AEleven officers convicted of crimes
OL,4,Astill on police payroll, chief confirms
OL,5,
OL,6,FFarrell also said the #4.5m annual cost
OL,7,Fof the 80 officers who are currently
OL,8,Fsuspended was down to "sluggish"
OL,9,Fconduct arrangements, as well as the
OL,10,Ftime necessary for cases to go through
OL,11,Fcourts.
OL,13,FShe described the state of affairs as
OL,14,F"intolerable" and called for a
OL,15,Fmodernisation of the police conduct
OL,16,Fregime.
